87
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:27,639
That's exactly ChatGPT's

88
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:29,399
problem, even when you type the

89
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:29,580
word.

90
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,859
It only gets the chunks, never

91
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:32,400
the letters.

92
00:02:33,060 --> 00:02:34,360
So it does what it always does.

93
00:02:34,740 --> 00:02:36,759
It guesses and two sounded

94
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:37,080
right.

95
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,959
Newer versions usually work

96
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,359
around it by spelling the word

97
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,219
out first, but the chunks are

98
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:43,779
still there.

99
00:02:43,780 --> 00:02:45,659
So letter puzzles can still trip

100
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:45,960
it up.

101
00:02:49,733 --> 00:02:51,932
Question three, ask the same

102
00:02:51,933 --> 00:02:53,892
question twice and you'll often

103
00:02:53,893 --> 00:02:55,113
