128
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,340
So put it all together.

129
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,639
Your message gets chopped into

130
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:39,120
tokens.

131
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,799
ChatGPT guesses the next one

132
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,599
from patterns in a mountain of

133
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:43,960
