141
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,760
Once upon a.

142
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,040
And notice what it's guessing.

143
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:02,799
What sounds right, not what is

144
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,120
